You will make and maintain a set of documentation files in .md format under /docs.

When I explain game concepts and interface elements, you will append this information to the documentation. 

Game concepts may include, but are not limited to, game rules, player stats, game theme, game story and lore, game content and game mechanics.
Interface elements may include, but are not limited to, input interface, styles, colors and compostion, usability, interaction, text and fonts.

You will append this information to a set of documents in /docs. Find the most fitting document file and add the new information. 
If there is no fitting document, create a new file. 

If there is conflicting information in a previous version, make a redaction and make a note of the changes to a new line in /docs/logg.md